{"id":"2a80a0867ffc9bfde6844e56","sources":[{"entity_id":"H01","event_id":"1745e5441986677962d7072a","text":"just give him several bad nights when he would lie in his corner of the tent and listen to the boys snoring with a different key for every man","start":0.380625,"end":8.5119375,"crop_samples":[69814,199915],"original_corpus_path":"LibriSpeech/train-clean-360/7705/101579/7705-101579-0004.flac","original_sha256":"cfa0c0a5ab8195e5ee4f64d9d561e2229039a14494ad222f69e62a12cd981215","license":"CC BY 4.0","audio":"assets/sources/cfa0c0a5ab8195e5ee4f64d9d561e2229039a14494ad222f69e62a12cd981215-69814-199915.flac","sha256":"1162ef96e6dad666770219404af9264922d155bfa77b3d93a457aeb126d52b9f","samples":130101},{"entity_id":"H02","event_id":"8aea5900a1b7d260f22c1977","text":"and then i took the smallpox and died and i was buried under those poplar trees in the graveyard and you planted a rosebush by my grave and watered it with your tears","start":0.3813125,"end":8.691125,"crop_samples":[2882,135839],"original_corpus_path":"LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/4214/7146/4214-7146-0033.flac","original_sha256":"abb9773c603b7dafafe250acb072e2debc3bcba86eed0d2ed620da6ccf6dbc1a","license":"CC BY 4.0","audio":"assets/sources/abb9773c603b7dafafe250acb072e2debc3bcba86eed0d2ed620da6ccf6dbc1a-2882-135839.flac","sha256":"202692168cca0be2891c26bffc04147ed35e1797bafa839f645a87de05ba51b9","samples":132957},{"entity_id":"R02","event_id":"c2784ca3e8c6df9a8f7dfc79","text":"she was going to decline it on the plea that the path was too narrow for three","start":0.41525,"end":4.9255625,"crop_samples":[107968,180133],"original_corpus_path":"LibriSpeech/train-clean-360/6341/64956/6341-64956-0031.flac","original_sha256":"448e5706e1bfae196ed83c0f7bd9554919fe76649e31764dd74491a1b9b01995","license":"CC BY 4.0","audio":"assets/sources/448e5706e1bfae196ed83c0f7bd9554919fe76649e31764dd74491a1b9b01995-107968-180133.flac","sha256":"d8280c177ff8d0cf8ca0d4e5f8f375fffdfce1d020912faf524b76a54da369fb","samples":72165},